    <Description>This macro types /bombarda and allows the caster to use it fast.
Can be used in the game "Magic Training"

About Bombarda:

The Exploding Charm, or Bombarda, is an offensive spell that summons an explosion at the point of impact. It deals 60 damage, leaving the opponent at critical health. It's good for crowd control, but suffers in close-quarters where the spell may backfire onto the caster.
A stronger, one-shot-kill version of the spell with a larger radius, Bombarda Maxima, formerly existed. It was removed due to abuse and spam because of its overpowered nature.

-AKA: The Exploding Charm
-Type: AoE
-Effect: Causes an explosion at the point of impact
-Counterspell: Episkey
(Magic Training Wiki)</Description>
